window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Heaven’s Dark Soldiers Box Set 2: Books 4–6</b></p> <p>Dawn of the After Days • Ride of the Horseman • Return of the Sky Gods</p> <p><b>One man’s angel is another man’s Devil.</b></p> <p>Dean survived the opening salvo of Heaven’s darkest war—but peace, real peace, was never part of the plan. As ancient forces awaken and cosmic chess pieces fall into place, the battles grow bigger, the enemies stranger, and the stakes... biblical.</p> <p>With the supernatural becoming mainstream in the most grandiose fashion and the secrets of the hidden world revealed, will mankind embrace the ‘new’ normal?</p> <p>Or, will life as we know it devolve into an apocalyptic battlefield of gods and monsters hell-bent on ushering in the end times? Pun intended.</p> <p>Either way, Dean and Doc have their work cut out for them.</p> <p>Pfft, no sweat?</p> <p><b>In this apocalyptic continuation of the saga:</b></p> <p><b>Dawn of the After Days</b> – With the world on the cusp of an angel incursion as a power hungry delegation of eclectic uber beings sort out the new world order, Dean and Doc must keep the peace—or die trying.</p> <p><b>Ride of the Horseman</b> – Just when you thought that everything might work out for the best, the pesky ole Horsemen of the Apocalypse show up in downtown Boston and throw everybody into a tizzy—again.</p> <p><b>Return of the Sky Gods</b> – The Anunnaki, an ancient race of malevolent über angels banished from Earth by God himself at the beginning of time, are back—and they’re not exactly friendly.</p> <p>From snark-laced showdowns to myth-forged battlegrounds, this second box set takes the Dark Soldierverse to new heights as mythology and the supernatural clash with everyday life like never before.</p> <p>The war isn’t over. It just got personal.</p>"; 
